<h3>2026-09-25 — AISYSTEM Now: grok.com usage + Hermes daily SuperGrok guard</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Coordinator Now block records live SuperGrok state: Firefox add-on reads grok.com Settings → Usage (Build/Chat % only), writes <code>grokcom_usage.json</code>, and a 15-minute guard spreads remaining Build % until 2026-10-01 10:31 PDT then switches new Hermes sessions to a free OpenRouter model.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> grok.com is not x.ai. SuperGrok is a weekly subscription bar, not prepaid cash. Last weeks hit 97–100%. The app cannot use grok.com cookies; the open Firefox tab can report numbers.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>AISYSTEMPlan.tt</code> <code>MASTER_PLAN.tt</code> <code>models/Grok.tt</code> <code>script/firefox-grokcom-usage/</code> <code>~/.hermes/scripts/supergrok_daily_guard.py</code> <code>.hermes/plans/2026-09-25-aisystem-usage-grokcom-guard.md</code></p>
